text ...Eh...?
text @[Tomoya]
text This isn't going to do...
sound BGV.aac
text @[Ryou]
text ...Tomoya-kun...
text @[Tomoya]
text Ryou. I...
text @[Tomoya]
text I...
setvar strS[1000] = "BG021Y"
