text I cannot get any words out of my mouth.
text A pair of eyes, filled with both tears and fear, are looking at me.
text I have to say it...
text If I don't say it here, it'll hurt her all the more...
text Even though I know... how come the words won't come out...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Ryou... I...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGRY25"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGRY25.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound BGW.aac
text @[Ryou]
text ...Mm!
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 0
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah...
text Ryou shakes my hands off, and runs out of the classroom.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ryou!
text As I yell her name, my eyes begin to burn.
text Although I want to run after her, my legs would not move.
text Even supposing that I manage to catch her, I can't get the words out.
text I am so pathetic...
text Even though I made up my mind, I kept thinking up excuses to keep myself clean.
text In the end, without having said anything, Ryou is left with a deep, painful wound.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ugh...!
text I pound on the wall very hard.
text It feels that I will not be able to stand back up without making myself feel pain.
text I hit it once again.
text The hot, blunt pain travels through my body.
text I never thought that I would be such a pathetic person...
text Really... I'm horrible...
text The pain torments me so much, my heart starts to creak...
music ~
